    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83489" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάσις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>moulding, conformation</i>, 
