				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					776a33
				</span></i>
			 ; of an infant, by massage, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.85
			</span></i> ; of a statue, <i>Rev.Ét.Anc.</i><i><span class="en">
				33.215
			</span></i> (Theangela, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); 
